      "writtenOn": "2026-11-11T15:45:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, so I did some investigating and discussing with @borenet@google.com. It looks like our Bazel builds for windows (like `BazelBuild-viewer-for_windows_x64_release-windows_x64`) are pulling in `windows-toolchain` when they probably shouldn\u0027t. This is most likely what the Bazel builds were quietly depending on. I\u0027ll write up a bug report tracking this. After landing this, we\u0027ll watch the tree and make sure everything is good. Then we can work on making sure our Bazel builds are truly hermetic.",
