      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmmm, maybe we should add these linkopts per target that needs them. Things like standard C++ library \"libcpmt.lib\" and other \"core\" libs live here, things like OpenGL and debug tools should be per target. Wdyt?\n\nFor example: dwrite.lib is already included in linkopts for `//src/ports:fontmgr_win_dw`, so there\u0027s a precedent for some of these being per-target. This will mean that we add these missing libs per target. It would still be worth adding a comment here clarifying this Bazel pattern.\n\nMay",
